  offerLine: Now let's see you serve it. Put leaf salad on the menu board by the door. When you close up for the day, the cafe cooks and sells what's on the menu. Close in the evening, after your foraging, and more guests come.
  activeLine: Leaf salad on the menu board, then close up for the day. Evening's best.
  readyLine: Ah, I heard the guests liked your salad. You'll do.
  doneLine: The cafe's in good claws.
